{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"天氣報告｜日間有陽光最高氣溫約28度　明日開始轉涼　周五跌至15、16度\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/OBS-FORECAST-261117-07.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】一股偏東氣流正影響廣東沿岸。本港今日(11月17日)天氣預測，部分時間有陽光。日間最高氣溫約28度。吹和緩東至東南風，初時離岸風勢間中清勁。</p><p>展望明日稍後轉吹偏北風，雲量增多，晚上氣溫下降。隨後一兩日顯著轉涼，星期五及星期六市區最低氣溫在15、16度左右，新界相當清涼。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T23:45:14.114759+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":143,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T23:15:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T14:48:53.001723+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T23:38:37.186355+00:00","content_hash":"c69d5df16e02fb1ad205500472c48e89c2a38379ba408aac54c0d628c7680bee","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-16T23:45:14.114759+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}